cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Knowledge Manifold pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic pipeline that embeds a document corpus into a fixed-frame,
  bounded 2-D knowledge manifold with continuous SPH/GPR fields and
  multi-metric geodesics, and exports machine-computed evidence packages for
  auditable verbalization.
type: software
